      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is a little bit too vague for my taste. The relationship between featureReady() and featureRemoved() also isn\u0027t clear from the CL. They aren\u0027t strictly symmetrical (there\u0027s no onFeatureAdded...). This might be resolved with some as simple as more-verbose docstrings pending clarification from breadley@",
